Language English

Book TortureChamber Ordered No Keep Looped

	Page Place
		Triggered By @ExploreTortureChamberViaDungeonCave
		
		Prolog """
			Looking through the bars in this door's window, you see things you'd
			hoped you'd never see.
		"""
		Button "Explore"

		Remove TokenExploreTortureChamberViaDungeonCave

		Text """
			This is a torture chamber. Along the walls are various devices for
			stretching, beating, burning, and cutting. You gulp thinking about
			what might have been done here. You and all investigators in your
			space take 2 facedown Horror ({will} negates).
			
			Discard this Explore token.
		"""

		exploredTortureChamber = true
	End Page Place

	Page PlaceRandom
		Add TokenSearchTortureChamberRandom!
		
		Text """
			One of the devices looks recently used. Place a Search token as
			indicated.
		"""
	End Page PlaceRandom

	Page PlaceExploreCell
		Add TokenExploreCellViaTortureChamber!
		
		Text "A door leads to what looks like a small cell."
		
		Trigger @MoveAfterExplore
		Exit
	End Page PlaceExploreCell
	
	Page SearchRandom
		Not Visible
		Triggered By @SearchTortureChamberRandom
		
		Prolog "An old restraint device seems to have been used recently."
		Button "Search"
		
		Remove TokenSearchTortureChamberRandom
		
		Text """
			As you hesitantly look over the rusty chains and ancient tools, you
			find something left behind. Gain the {c:QItemRandomEquipment} Common
			Item, then discard this Search token.
		"""
		
		Exit
	End Page SearchRandom	
End Book TortureChamber